1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Yudhisthira (Sanskrit: युधिष्ठिर, yudhiṣṭhira meaning "steady in war", from yuddha meaning war, and sṭhira meaning steady), the eldest son of King Pandu and Queen Kunti, was king of Indraprastha and later of Hastin
2 CONC apura. He was the leader of the Pandava side in the Kurukshetra War.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yudhishtira
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT RULED INDRAPRASTHA FOR  36 YEARS 8 MONTHS AND 25DAYS
2 CONT
2 CONT Maharaja Yudhisthira
2 CONT
