2 CONC ed, followed by a twin brother named Nakula Sahadeva. When Nakula fell to the ground, Bhima said to Yudhishthira, "My brother, sister we are very diligent and obedient. He was also very handsome and there is no match. Why did she 
2 CONC die here?". The wise Yudhishthira replied, "It is true that he is very diligent and we are pleased to execute commands. But know, that Nakula very proud of its good looks, and will not budge. Because of his attitude, he just lives
2 CONC  up to here". After hearing Yudhisthira, Bhima and Arjuna then continue their journey. They left the bodies there Nakula, without a proper burning ceremony, but the spirit of Nakula reach peace.
