2 CONT
2 CONT Also known as SISUPALA The third and final incarnation ofVijaya, the cheeky gate keeper ofVaikuntha, born with three eyes and four arms. His extra bits and bobs fell off when he sat on a certain Gods knee, and under normal circums
2 CONC tances this would be wonderful news, but a mysterious voice had forewarned his parents that the same guy would also own the hands thatShishupula would die by. 
2 CONT
2 CONT So, Shishupala was getting ready for his marriage to Rukmini, suited and booted and ready to roll, when the very same God turned up and threw a spanner in the works by sweeping his wife-to-be off her feet. It turns out Rukmini was
2 CONC  an Avatar of Lakshmi who never wanted to marry Shishupala in the first place and to make matters worse Krishna was actually Shishupula's cousin who had rid him of his extra body parts all those years ago.
