2 CONC  HIS PRECEPTOR VASISHTA. HIS THIRD SIN WAS THAT HE USED THE UN SANCTIFIED MEAT OF HIS KILL AS FOOD. TRISHANKU ALSO HAD A DESIRE TO ASCEND TO HEAVEN IN HIS MORTAL BODY. AFTER VASISHTA REFUSED HIM THIS BOON, SINCE IT IS AGAINST NATU
2 CONC RE TO ASCEND INTO HEAVEN AS A MORTAL, THE SAGE VISWAMITRA, VASISHTA'S RIVAL, CREATED ANTHER HEAVEN FOR HIM, CALLED "TRISHANKU'S HEAVEN", AND LOCATED IN  MID-AIR. HIS SON WAS HARISHCHANDRA WHO IS KNOWN FOR HIS HONESTY, TRUTH AND DE
2 CONC VOTION TO DUTY OR DHARMA. 
