1 NAME Sri Maharajadiraja Sri Kertanegara Wikrama Dharmatunggadewa Raja Singasari
2 GIVN Sri Maharajadiraja Sri Kertanegara Wikrama Dharmatunggadewa
2 NSFX Raja Singasari
2 NICK Sri Maharaja Kertanagara
2 NICK Sri Maharaja Sri Lokawijaya Purusottama Wira Asta Basudewadhipa Aniwariwiryanindita Parakrama Murddhaja Namottunggadewa
