1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (2) Tun Perpatih Sendang, Bendahara Sri Wak Raja. Appointed as Bendahara in succession to Bendahara Sri Amar di-Raja. He d. (took poison after being insulted by Sultan Muzaffar Shah), at Malacca, after 1445, having
2 CONC  had issue, two sons and one daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT (a) Tun Perak, Bendahara Paduka Raja. b. before 1426.
2 CONT
2 CONT (b) Tun Perpateh Puteh, Bendahara Puteh. Special Ambassador to China. Bendahara in succession to his elder brother. He d. ca 1500, having had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT (c) Tun Kudu.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tun Perpatih Sendang (Bendahara Seri Wak Raja) merupakan putera kedua Tun Perpatih Tulus, dilantik menjadi Bendahara Melaka menggantikan kekandanya Tun Hamzah (Seri Amar DiRaja) semasa pemerintahan Sultan Muzaffar Shah (1445 – 144
2 CONC 9).
